    "title": "Man hospitalized after being found stabbed outside Daly City BART station, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago\nBART Police are investigating a stabbing that happened outside the BART station, near the bus zone on Wednesday.\nFirst responders were called around 3:15 p.m.\nBART Police say a man was stabbed and is now hospitalized.\nMORE: Shooting on BART train approaching Fruitvale Station injures teen, officials say\nThere's no word on his condition.\nTrains weren't stopping at the station for about 30 minutes, but operations have resumed.\nIf you're on the ABC7 News app, click here to watch live",
